s of biofilm formation in <italic>Shewanella oneidensis</italic> MR-1</article-title><source>J Bacteriol</source><year>2004</year><volume>186</volume><fpage>8096</fpage><lpage>8104</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15547283</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>